QMacStyle: Fix the title margins of small push buttons under Liquid Glass

Backport of qtbase 779f7dde903b10f313c2692b593f964e7136da79 (Qt 6.10.1,
QTBUG-139944), which is not in 6.8.5.

6.8.5 already has b027f12392223db66914ec9d8c8824fb203c868f, which moves
the title of a push button of the regular size with Liquid Glass. A push
button of the small size needs the same vertical adjustment; the mini
size is fine as it is. Only Liquid Glass is affected.

--- a/qtbase/src/plugins/styles/mac/qmacstyle_mac.mm
+++ b/qtbase/src/plugins/styles/mac/qmacstyle_mac.mm
@@ -1791,8 +1791,11 @@
                 return QMarginsF(12, 6, 12, 8);
             return QMarginsF(12, 5, 12, 9);
         }
-        if (size == QStyleHelper::SizeSmall)
+        if (size == QStyleHelper::SizeSmall) {
+            if (qt_apple_runningWithLiquidGlass())
+                return QMarginsF(12, 6, 12, 7);
             return QMarginsF(12, 4, 12, 9);
+        }
         if (size == QStyleHelper::SizeMini)
             return QMarginsF(10, 1, 10, 2);
     }
